('da3ba7bf-ad19-5778-b702-dbaebebbbb5d', '683a1a72-6900-4e3c-a063-dca54eb50d4a', '11e7164b-e47d-4b4d-8bad-1002c892ba20', 'a-level', '1.5', '9702 coursebook 1.5 · Combining displacements', 31, 31, 'A crane lifts a load 12 m vertically and swings it 9.0 m horizontally. Calculate the load''s displacement magnitude.', NULL, 2, 'numeric'::answer_type, '15', 'm', false, NULL, false, NULL, 's = √(12² + 9.0²) = 15 m. Mark scheme (3 marks). C1: perpendicular. C1: value. A1: s = 15 m.', 3, '<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 360 280" role="img" aria-labelledby="fg3f0d51c3-t fg3f0d51c3-d" style="font-family:ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,''Segoe UI'',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;max-width:100%;height:auto"><title id="fg3f0d51c3-t">Crane load</title><desc id="fg3f0d51c3-d">A load lifted 12 m vertically and moved 9.0 m horizontally; the resultant displacement is dashed.</desc><line x1="109.5" y1="234" x2="109.5" y2="52.3" style="stroke:var(--fig-accent,#1d4ed8);stroke-width:2.0;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><polygon points="109.5,46 113.3,54.2 105.7,54.2" style="fill:var(--fig-accent,#1d4ed8);stroke:none"/><text x="95.5" y="144" font-size="12" text-anchor="end" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:var(--fig-accent,#1d4ed8)">12 m</text><line x1="109.5" y1="46" x2="244.2" y2="46" style="stroke:var(--fig-accent-2,#b45309);stroke-width:2.0;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><polygon points="250.5,46 242.3,49.8 242.3,42.2" style="fill:var(--fig-accent-2,#b45309);stroke:none"/><text x="180" y="32" font-size="12" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:var(--fig-accent-2,#b45309)">9.0 m</text><line x1="109.5" y1="234" x2="246.7" y2="51" style="stroke:var(--fig-muted,#6b7280);stroke-width:1.4;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round;stroke-dasharray:6 4"/><polygon points="250.5,46 248.6,54.8 242.6,50.2" style="fill:var(--fig-muted,#6b7280);stroke:none"/><text x="168.8" y="131.6" font-size="12" text-anchor="end" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:var(--fig-muted,#6b7280)">s</text><circle cx="109.5" cy="234" r="3.4" style="fill:currentColor;stroke:none"/></svg>', 'A load lifted 12 m vertically and moved 9.0 m horizontally; the resultant displacement is dashed.'),
