"12" text-anchor="start" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:var(--fig-muted,#6b7280)">25 m</text><circle cx="68" cy="234" r="3.4" style="fill:currentColor;stroke:none"/><line x1="68" y1="234" x2="112" y2="234" style="stroke:var(--fig-grid,#d1d5db);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round;stroke-dasharray:3 3"/><path d="M98,234 A30,30 0 0,0 91,214.7" style="stroke:var(--fig-muted,#6b7280);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><text x="107.4" y="219.6" font-size="12" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:currentColor">40°</text></svg>', 'A 25 m displacement at 40° to the horizontal (dashed) with its horizontal and vertical components.'),
('3acc3b11-34bd-5335-be0e-71b3abe4304a', '683a1a72-6900-4e3c-a063-dca54eb50d4a', '11e7164b-e47d-4b4d-8bad-1002c892ba20', 'a-level', '1.5', '9702 coursebook 1.5 · Combining displacements', 33, 33, 'Two displacements, 8.0 km and 5.0 km, are separated by an angle of 60° when drawn from the same point. Calculate the magnitude of their resultant.', NULL, 2, 'numeric'::answer_type, '11.36 km', 'km', false, NULL, false, NULL, 'In the head-to-tail triangle the enclosed angle is 180 − 60 = 120°. s = √(8.0² + 5.0² − 2 × 8.0 × 5.0 × cos 120°) = 11.4 km. Mark scheme (4 marks). M1: triangle angle 120°. C1: cosine rule. C1: value. A1: s = 11.4 km.', 4, '<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 340 260" role="img" aria-labelledby="fga62f5137-t fga62f5137-d" style="font-family:ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,''Segoe UI'',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;max-width:100%;height:auto"><title id="fga62f5137-t">Parallelogram rule</title><desc id="fga62f5137-d">Displacements of 8.0 km and 5.0 km drawn from the same point, 60° apart, with the resultant (dashed) by the parallelogram rule.</desc><line x1="59.6" y1="175.5" x2="221.5" y2="175.5" style="stroke:var(--fig-accent,#1d4ed8);stroke-width:2.0;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><polygon points="227.8,175.5 219.7,179.3 219.7,171.7" style="fill:var(--fig-accent,#1d4ed8);stroke:none"/><text x="241.8" y="179.5" font-size="12" text-anchor="start" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:var(--fig-accent,#1d4ed8)">8.0 km</text><line x1="59.6" y1="175.5" x2="109" y2="89.9" style="stroke:var(--fig-accent-2,#b45309);stroke-width:2.0;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><polygon points="112.2,84.5 111.4,93.4 104.8,89.6" style="fill:var(--fig-accent-2,#b45309);stroke:none"/><text x="119.2" y="76.3" font-size="12" text-anchor="start" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:var(--fig-accent-2,#b45309)">5.0 km</text><line x1="227.8" y1="175.5" x2="280.4" y2="84.5" style="stroke:var(--fig-grid,#d1d5db);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round;stroke-dasharray:3 3"/><line x1="112.2" y1="84.5" x2="280.4" y2="84.5" style="stroke:var(--fig-grid,#d1d5db);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round;stroke-dasharray:3 3"/><line x1="59.6" y1="175.5" x2="274.6" y2="86.9" style="stroke:var(--fig-muted,#6b7280);stroke-width:1.4;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round;stroke-dasharray:6 4"/><polygon points="280.4,84.5 274.3,91.1 271.4,84" style="fill:var(--fig-muted,#6b7280);stroke:none"/><text x="290.4" y="76.5" font-size="12" text-anchor="start" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:var(--fig-muted,#6b7280)">s</text><circle cx="59.6" cy="175.5" r="3.4" style="fill:currentColor;stroke:none"/></svg>', 'Displacements of 8.0 km and 5.0 km drawn from the same point, 60° apart, with the resultant (dashed) by the parallelogram rule.'),
('1d562068-a70d-5d97-aae2-ef32832720df', '683a1a72-6900-4e3c-a063-dca54eb50d4a', '11e7164b-e47d-4b4d-8bad-1002c892ba20', 'a-level', '1.5', '9702 coursebook 1.5 · Combining displacements', 34, 34, 'A resultant displacement is to be found from three legs at various angles. Which method is most reliable?', NULL, 2, 'multiple_choice'::answer_type, 'Resolve each into perpendicular components, add the components, then combine', NULL, false, NULL, false, NULL, 'Components can be added as ordinary numbers. Mark scheme (3 marks). C1: resolve. C1: add components, Pythagoras. A1: A (Resolve each into perpendicular components, add the components, then combine).', 3, NULL, NULL),
('cea8b84c-af87-5d09-869e-7f3afcf7721c', '683a1a72-6900-4e3c-a063-dca54eb50d4a', '11e7164b-e47d-4b4d-8bad-1002c892ba20', 'a-level', '1.5', '9702 coursebook 1.5 · Combining displacements', 35, 35, 'A bird flies 300 m on a bearing of 210°. Calculate the southward component of its displacement.', NULL, 2, 'numeric'::answer_type, '259.8', 'm', false, NULL, false, NULL, '210° is 30° west of south. South component = 300 cos 30° = 260 m. Mark scheme (3 marks). C1: angle from south. C1: value. A1: s_S = 260 m.', 3, '<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 360 280" role="img" aria-labelledby="fgf7716128-t fgf7716128-d" style="font-family:ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,''Segoe UI'',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;max-width:100%;height:auto"><title id="fgf7716128-t">Bird flight</title><desc id="fgf7716128-d">A displacement of 300 m on a bearing of 210° (dashed) shown with its west and south components.</desc><line x1="234.3" y1="46" x2="132" y2="46" style="stroke:var(--fig-accent,#1d4ed8);stroke-width:2.0;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><polygon points="125.7,46 133.9,42.2 133.9,49.8" style="fill:var(--fig-accent,#1d4ed8);stroke:none"/><text x="180" y="32" font-size="12" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:var(--fig-accent,#1d4ed8)">west</text><line x1="125.7" y1="46" x2="125.7" y2="227.7" style="stroke:var(--fig-accent-2,#b45309);stroke-width:2.0;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><polygon points="125.7,234 121.9,225.8 129.5,225.8" style="fill:var(--fig-accent-2,#b45309);stroke:none"/><text x="111.7" y="144" font-size="12" text-anchor="end" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:var(--fig-accent-2,#b45309)">south</text><line x1="234.3" y1="46" x2="128.9" y2="228.5" style="stroke:var(--fig-muted,#6b7280);stroke-width:1.4;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round;stroke-dasharray:6 4"/><polygon points="125.7,234 126.5,225 133.1,228.8" style="fill:var(--fig-muted,#6b7280);stroke:none"/><text x="167.9" y="133" font-size="12" text-anchor="end" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:var(--fig-muted,#6b7280)">300 m</text><circle cx="234.3" cy="46" r="3.4" style="fill:currentColor;stroke:none"/><line x1="234.3" y1="46" x2="234.3" y2="90" style="stroke:var(--fig-grid,#d1d5db);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round;stroke-dasharray:3 3"/><path d="M234.3,76 A30,30 0 0,1 219.3,72" style="stroke:var(--fig-muted,#6b7280);stroke-width:0.9;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><text x="223.4" y="86.6" font-size="12" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:currentColor">30°</text><line x1="338" y1="50" x2="338" y2="22.9" style="stroke:var(--fig-muted,#6b7280);stroke-width:1.4;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><polygon points="338,18 341,24.3 335,24.3" style="fill:var(--fig-muted,#6b7280);stroke:none"/><text x="338" y="9" font-size="12" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:currentColor;font-weight:600">N</text></svg>', 'A displacement of 300 m on a bearing of 210° (dashed) shown with its west and south components.'),
('fe8e7fc2-7f59-536b-a3a9-8687fded284f', '683a1a72-6900-4e3c-a063-dca54eb50d4a', '11e7164b-e47d-4b4d-8bad-1002c892ba20', 'a-level', '1.5', '9702 coursebook 1.5 · Combining displacements', 36, 36, 'A walker covers 2.5 km north, 1.5 km east and 0.5 km north. Calculate the magnitude of her displacement.', NULL, 2, 'numeric'::answer_type, '3.354 km', 'km', false, NULL, false, NULL, 'North: 2.5 + 0.5 = 3.0 km; east: 1.5 km. s = √(3.0² + 1.5²) = 3.35 km. Mark scheme (3 marks). C1: combine north legs. C1: Pythagoras. A1: s = 3.35 km.', 3, '<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 360 280" role="img" aria-labelledby="fg9b7c3e5a-t fg9b7c3e5a-d" style="font-family:ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,''Segoe UI'',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;max-width:100%;height:auto"><title id="fg9b7c3e5a-t">Three legs</title><desc id="fg9b7c3e5a-d">A walk of 2.5 km north, 1.5 km east and 0.5 km north; the resultant is dashed.</desc><line x1="133" y1="234" x2="133" y2="83.6" style="stroke:var(--fig-accent,#1d4ed8);stroke-width:2.0;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><polygon points="133,77.3 136.8,85.5 129.2,85.5" style="fill:var(--fig-accent,#1d4ed8);stroke:none"/><text x="119" y="159.7" font-size="12" text-anchor="end" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:var(--fig-accent,#1d4ed8)">2.5 km</text><line x1="133" y1="77.3" x2="220.7" y2="77.3" style="stroke:var(--fig-accent-2,#b45309);stroke-width:2.0;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><polygon points="227,77.3 218.8,81.1 218.8,73.5" style="fill:var(--fig-accent-2,#b45309);stroke:none"/><text x="180" y="63.3" font-size="12" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:var(--fig-accent-2,#b45309)">1.5 km</text><line x1="227" y1="77.3" x2="227" y2="52.3" style="stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:2.0;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><polygon points="227,46 230.8,54.2 223.2,54.2" style="fill:currentColor;stroke:none"/><text x="241" y="65.7" font-size="12" text-anchor="start" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:currentColor">0.5 km</text><line x1="133" y1="234" x2="224.2" y2="51.6" style="stroke:var(--fig-muted,#6b7280);stroke-width:1.4;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round;stroke-dasharray:6 4"/><polygon points="227,46 226.8,55 220,51.6" style="fill:var(--fig-muted,#6b7280);stroke:none"/><text x="167.5" y="133.7" font-size="12" text-anchor="end" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:var(--fig-muted,#6b7280)">s</text><circle cx="133" cy="234" r="3.4" style="fill:currentColor;stroke:none"/><line x1="338" y1="50" x2="338" y2="22.9" style="stroke:var(--fig-muted,#6b7280);stroke-width:1.4;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><polygon points="338,18 341,24.3 335,24.3" style="fill:var(--fig-muted,#6b7280);stroke:none"/><text x="338" y="9" font-size="12" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:currentColor;font-weight:600">N</text></svg>', 'A walk of 2.5 km north, 1.5 km east and 0.5 km north; the resultant is dashed.'),
('2609c6ae-653d-55fd-aa04-d586e3fed329', '683a1a72-6900-4e3c-a063-dca54eb50d4a', '11e7164b-e47d-4b4d-8bad-1002c892ba20', 'a-level', '1.5', '9702 coursebook 1.5 · Combining displacements', 37, 37, 'A boat travels 900 m due east and then 1200 m due south. Calculate the bearing of its final position from the start.', NULL, 2, 'numeric'::answer_type, '143.1', '°', false, NULL, false, NULL, 'Angle east of south = tan⁻¹(900 ÷ 1200) = 36.9°. Bearing = 180 − 36.9 = 143°. Mark scheme (3 marks). C1: angle. C1: bearing. A1: bearing = 143°.', 3, '<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 360 280" role="img" aria-labelledby="fg1f9698e0-t fg1f9698e0-d" style="font-family:ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,''Segoe UI'',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;max-width:100%;height:auto"><title id="fg1f9698e0-t">Boat course</title><desc id="fg1f9698e0-d">A boat travels 900 m east then 1200 m south; the resultant is dashed.</desc><line x1="109.5" y1="46" x2="244.2" y2="46" style="stroke:var(--fig-accent,#1d4ed8);stroke-width:2.0;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><polygon points="250.5,46 242.3,49.8 242.3,42.2" style="fill:var(--fig-accent,#1d4ed8);stroke:none"/><text x="180" y="32" font-size="12" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:var(--fig-accent,#1d4ed8)">900 m</text><line x1="250.5" y1="46" x2="250.5" y2="227.7" style="stroke:var(--fig-accent-2,#b45309);stroke-width:2.0;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><polygon points="250.5,234 246.7,225.8 254.3,225.8" style="fill:var(--fig-accent-2,#b45309);stroke:none"/><text x="264.5" y="144" font-size="12" text-anchor="start" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:var(--fig-accent-2,#b45309)">1200 m</text><line x1="109.5" y1="46" x2="246.7" y2="229" style="stroke:var(--fig-muted,#6b7280);stroke-width:1.4;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round;stroke-dasharray:6 4"/><polygon points="250.5,234 242.6,229.8 248.6,225.2" style="fill:var(--fig-muted,#6b7280);stroke:none"/><text x="191.2" y="131.6" font-size="12" text-anchor="start" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:var(--fig-muted,#6b7280)">s</text><circle cx="109.5" cy="46" r="3.4" style="fill:currentColor;stroke:none"/><line x1="338" y1="50" x2="338" y2="22.9" style="stroke:var(--fig-muted,#6b7280);stroke-width:1.4;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><polygon points="338,18 341,24.3 335,24.3" style="fill:var(--fig-muted,#6b7280);stroke:none"/><text x="338" y="9" font-size="12" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:currentColor;font-weight:600">N</text></svg>', 'A boat travels 900 m east then 1200 m south; the resultant is dashed.'),
('85ecc56d-120d-5e65-b910-52774afa2745', '683a1a72-6900-4e3c-a063-dca54eb50d4a', '11e7164b-e47d-4b4d-8bad-1002c892ba20', 'a-level', '1.5', '9702 coursebook 1.5 · Combining displacements', 38, 38, 'A bee flies 30 m north-east, then 30 m south-east, then 30 m south-west. Calculate the magnitude of its displacement.', NULL, 2, 'numeric'::answer_type, '30', 'm', false, NULL, false, NULL, 'The NE and SW legs cancel, leaving the SE leg: s = 30 + 30 − 30 = 30 m towards the south-east. Mark scheme (3 marks). C1: opposite legs cancel. C1: value. A1: s = 30 m.', 3, '<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 360 280" role="img" aria-labelledby="fg489cc91c-t fg489cc91c-d" style="font-family:ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,''Segoe UI'',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;max-width:100%;height:auto"><title id="fg489cc91c-t">Bee flight</title><desc id="fg489cc91c-d">A bee flies 30 m north-east, 30 m south-east and 30 m south-west; the resultant is dashed.</desc><line x1="86" y1="140" x2="175.5" y2="50.5" style="stroke:var(--fig-accent,#1d4ed8);stroke-width:2.0;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><polygon points="180,46 176.9,54.5 171.5,49.1" style="fill:var(--fig-accent,#1d4ed8);stroke:none"/><text x="123.1" y="83.1" font-size="12" text-anchor="end" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:var(--fig-accent,#1d4ed8)">30 m</text><line x1="180" y1="46" x2="269.5" y2="135.5" style="stroke:var(--fig-accent-2,#b45309);stroke-width:2.0;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><polygon points="274,140 265.5,136.9 270.9,131.5" style="fill:var(--fig-accent-2,#b45309);stroke:none"/><text x="236.9" y="83.1" font-size="12" text-anchor="start" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:var(--fig-accent-2,#b45309)">30 m</text><line x1="274" y1="140" x2="184.5" y2="229.5" style="stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:2.0;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><polygon points="180,234 183.1,225.5 188.5,230.9" style="fill:currentColor;stroke:none"/><text x="236.9" y="196.9" font-size="12" text-anchor="start" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:currentColor">30 m</text><line x1="86" y1="140" x2="175.5" y2="229.5" style="stroke:var(--fig-muted,#6b7280);stroke-width:1.4;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round;stroke-dasharray:6 4"/><polygon points="180,234 171.5,230.9 176.9,225.5" style="fill:var(--fig-muted,#6b7280);stroke:none"/><text x="142.9" y="177.1" font-size="12" text-anchor="start" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:var(--fig-muted,#6b7280)">s</text><circle cx="86" cy="140" r="3.4" style="fill:currentColor;stroke:none"/><line x1="338" y1="50" x2="338" y2="22.9" style="stroke:var(--fig-muted,#6b7280);stroke-width:1.4;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><polygon points="338,18 341,24.3 335,24.3" style="fill:var(--fig-muted,#6b7280);stroke:none"/><text x="338" y="9" font-size="12" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:currentColor;font-weight:600">N</text></svg>', 'A bee flies 30 m north-east, 30 m south-east and 30 m south-west; the resultant is dashed.'),
('bbab47d0-b4a4-5fac-ac46-0051043dbd9f', '683a1a72-6900-4e3c-a063-dca54eb50d4a', '11e7164b-e47d-4b4d-8bad-1002c892ba20', 'a-level', '1.5', '9702 coursebook 1.5 · Combining displacements', 39, 39, 'A ball is kicked 25 m due east and then 15 m towards the north-east. Calculate the magnitude of its displacement.', NULL, 2, 'numeric'::answer_type, '37.15', 'm', false, NULL, false, NULL, 'Angle inside the triangle = 135°. s = √(25² + 15² − 2 × 25 × 15 × cos 135°) = 37.2 m. Mark scheme (3 marks). C1: 135° angle. C1: cosine rule. A1: s = 37.2 m.', 3, '<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 360 280" role="img" aria-labelledby="fgb4144ddd-t fgb4144ddd-d" style="font-family:ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,''Segoe UI'',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;max-width:100%;height:auto"><title id="fgb4144ddd-t">Two kicks</title><desc id="fgb4144ddd-d">Displacements of 25 m east then 15 m north-east; the resultant is dashed.</desc><line x1="53.2" y1="177.8" x2="224.9" y2="177.8" style="stroke:var(--fig-accent,#1d4ed8);stroke-width:2.0;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><polygon points="231.2,177.8 223.1,181.6 223.1,174" style="fill:var(--fig-accent,#1d4ed8);stroke:none"/><text x="142.2" y="191.8" font-size="12" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:var(--fig-accent,#1d4ed8)">25 m</text><line x1="231.2" y1="177.8" x2="302.3" y2="106.7" style="stroke:var(--fig-accent-2,#b45309);stroke-width:2.0;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><polygon points="306.8,102.2 303.7,110.7 298.3,105.3" style="fill:var(--fig-accent-2,#b45309);stroke:none"/><text x="278.9" y="149.9" font-size="12" text-anchor="start" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:var(--fig-accent-2,#b45309)">15 m</text><line x1="53.2" y1="177.8" x2="300.7" y2="104" style="stroke:var(--fig-muted,#6b7280);stroke-width:1.4;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round;stroke-dasharray:6 4"/><polygon points="306.8,102.2 300,108.2 297.9,100.9" style="fill:var(--fig-muted,#6b7280);stroke:none"/><text x="184" y="153.4" font-size="12" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:var(--fig-muted,#6b7280)">s</text><circle cx="53.2" cy="177.8" r="3.4" style="fill:currentColor;stroke:none"/><line x1="338" y1="50" x2="338" y2="22.9" style="stroke:var(--fig-muted,#6b7280);stroke-width:1.4;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><polygon points="338,18 341,24.3 335,24.3" style="fill:var(--fig-muted,#6b7280);stroke:none"/><text x="338" y="9" font-size="12" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:currentColor;font-weight:600">N</text></svg>', 'Displacements of 25 m east then 15 m north-east; the resultant is dashed.'),
('ba9cfb07-6ced-5bb7-bacb-3499af9db084', '683a1a72-6900-4e3c-a063-dca54eb50d4a', '11e7164b-e47d-4b4d-8bad-1002c892ba20', 'a-level', '1.5', '9702 coursebook 1.5 · Combining displacements', 40, 40, 'A diver descends 18 m vertically while drifting 6.0 m horizontally. Calculate the angle of her displacement below the horizontal.', NULL, 2, 'numeric'::answer_type, '71.57', '°', false, NULL, false, NULL, 'θ = tan⁻¹(18 ÷ 6.0) = 71.6°. Mark scheme (3 marks). C1: tan θ = vertical/horizontal. C1: value. A1: θ = 71.6°.', 3, NULL, NULL),
('ae36714c-f27b-51e7-bd0c-f8d2a55c175c', '683a1a72-6900-4e3c-a063-dca54eb50d4a', '11e7164b-e47d-4b4d-8bad-1002c892ba20', 'a-level', '1.5', '9702 coursebook 1.5 · Combining displacements', 41, 41, 'A hiker walks 4.0 km on a bearing of 030°, then 6.0 km on a bearing of 120°. (a) Show that the legs are perpendicular. (b) Calculate the magnitude of the resultant. (c) Find its bearing.', NULL, 3, 'numeric'::answer_type, '86.31', '°', false, NULL, false, NULL, '(a) 120 − 30 = 90°. (b) s = √(4.0² + 6.0²) = 7.21 km. (c) Angle from first leg = tan⁻¹(6.0 ÷ 4.0) = 56.3°; bearing = 30 + 56.3 = 86.3°. Mark scheme (5 marks). B1: right angle. C1: magnitude. M1: angle from first leg. C1: bearing. A1: bearing = 86.3°.', 5, '<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 360 280" role="img" aria-labelledby="fgc2582554-t fgc2582554-d" style="font-family:ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,''Segoe UI'',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;max-width:100%;height:auto"><title id="fgc2582554-t">Hike on bearings</title><desc id="fgc2582554-d">A hike of 4.0 km on a bearing of 030° then 6.0 km on a bearing of 120°; the resultant is dashed.</desc><line x1="63.6" y1="196.1" x2="125.1" y2="89.4" style="stroke:var(--fig-accent,#1d4ed8);stroke-width:2.0;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><polygon points="128.3,83.9 127.5,92.9 120.9,89.1" style="fill:var(--fig-accent,#1d4ed8);stroke:none"/><text x="83.8" y="133" font-size="12" text-anchor="end" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:var(--fig-accent,#1d4ed8)">4.0 km</text><line x1="128.3" y1="83.9" x2="291" y2="177.9" style="stroke:var(--fig-accent-2,#b45309);stroke-width:2.0;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><polygon points="296.4,181 287.5,180.2 291.3,173.7" style="fill:var(--fig-accent-2,#b45309);stroke:none"/><text x="219.4" y="120.4" font-size="12" text-anchor="start" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:var(--fig-accent-2,#b45309)">6.0 km</text><line x1="63.6" y1="196.1" x2="290.2" y2="181.4" style="stroke:var(--fig-muted,#6b7280);stroke-width:1.4;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round;stroke-dasharray:6 4"/><polygon points="296.4,181 288.5,185.4 288.1,177.8" style="fill:var(--fig-muted,#6b7280);stroke:none"/><text x="179.1" y="174.6" font-size="12" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:var(--fig-muted,#6b7280)">s</text><circle cx="63.6" cy="196.1" r="3.4" style="fill:currentColor;stroke:none"/><line x1="338" y1="50" x2="338" y2="22.9" style="stroke:var(--fig-muted,#6b7280);stroke-width:1.4;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><polygon points="338,18 341,24.3 335,24.3" style="fill:var(--fig-muted,#6b7280);stroke:none"/><text x="338" y="9" font-size="12" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:currentColor;font-weight:600">N</text></svg>', 'A hike of 4.0 km on a bearing of 030° then 6.0 km on a bearing of 120°; the resultant is dashed.'),
('0c8d1811-3568-59be-8340-33a49c91dc48', '683a1a72-6900-4e3c-a063-dca54eb50d4a', '11e7164b-e47d-4b4d-8bad-1002c892ba20', 'a-level', '1.5', '9702 coursebook 1.5 · Combining displacements', 42, 42, 'A ship sails 12 km on a bearing of 050°, then 8.0 km on a bearing of 170°. (a) Resolve both legs into east and north components. (b) Find the resultant components. (c) Calculate the magnitude of the resultant displacement.', NULL, 3, 'numeric'::answer_type, '10.58 km', 'km', false, NULL, false, NULL, '(a) Leg 1: E = 12 sin 50° = 9.193, N = 12 cos 50° = 7.713. Leg 2: E = 8.0 sin 170° = 1.389, N = 8.0 cos 170° = −7.878. (b) E = 10.58, N = −0.1650. (c) s = √(10.58² + (−0.1650)²) = 10.6 km. Mark scheme (6 marks). C1: leg 1 components. C1: leg 2 components. C1: sums. M1: Pythagoras. C1: value. A1: s = 10.6 km.', 6, '<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 360 280" role="img" aria-labelledby="fga9d68e94-t fga9d68e94-d" style="font-family:ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,''Segoe UI'',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;max-width:100%;height:auto"><title id="fga9d68e94-t">Ship on two bearings</title><desc id="fga9d68e94-d">A ship sails 12 km on a bearing of 050° then 8.0 km on a bearing of 170°; the resultant is dashed.</desc><line x1="63.6" y1="223.1" x2="261" y2="57.4" style="stroke:var(--fig-accent,#1d4ed8);stroke-width:2.0;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><polygon points="265.9,53.3 262.1,61.5 257.2,55.6" style="fill:var(--fig-accent,#1d4ed8);stroke:none"/><text x="155.7" y="127.5" font-size="12" text-anchor="end" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:var(--fig-accent,#1d4ed8)">12 km</text><line x1="265.9" y1="53.3" x2="295.3" y2="220.5" style="stroke:var(--fig-accent-2,#b45309);stroke-width:2.0;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><polygon points="296.4,226.7 291.3,219.3 298.8,218" style="fill:var(--fig-accent-2,#b45309);stroke:none"/><text x="294.9" y="141.6" font-size="12" text-anchor="start" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:var(--fig-accent-2,#b45309)">8.0 km</text><line x1="63.6" y1="223.1" x2="290.1" y2="226.6" style="stroke:var(--fig-muted,#6b7280);stroke-width:1.4;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round;stroke-dasharray:6 4"/><polygon points="296.4,226.7 288.2,230.4 288.3,222.8" style="fill:var(--fig-muted,#6b7280);stroke:none"/><text x="180.2" y="210.9" font-size="12" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:var(--fig-muted,#6b7280)">s</text><circle cx="63.6" cy="223.1" r="3.4" style="fill:currentColor;stroke:none"/><line x1="338" y1="50" x2="338" y2="22.9" style="stroke:var(--fig-muted,#6b7280);stroke-width:1.4;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><polygon points="338,18 341,24.3 335,24.3" style="fill:var(--fig-muted,#6b7280);stroke:none"/><text x="338" y="9" font-size="12" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:currentColor;font-weight:600">N</text></svg>', 'A ship sails 12 km on a bearing of 050° then 8.0 km on a bearing of 170°; the resultant is dashed.'),
('ca97956f-e2c2-5fc6-a920-4dc912863408', '683a1a72-6900-4e3c-a063-dca54eb50d4a', '11e7164b-e47d-4b4d-8bad-1002c892ba20', 'a-level', '1.5', '9702 coursebook 1.5 · Combining displacements', 43, 43, 'Two displacements of 5.0 m and 12 m are drawn from the same point at an angle of 90° to each other. (a) Calculate the resultant. (b) Calculate the angle between the resultant and the 12 m displacement.', NULL, 3, 'numeric'::answer_type, '22.62', '°', false, NULL, false, NULL, '(a) s = √(5.0² + 12²) = 13 m. (b) θ = tan⁻¹(5.0 ÷ 12) = 22.6°. Mark scheme (5 marks). C1: Pythagoras. C1: 13 m. M1: tan θ. C1: value. A1: θ = 22.6°.', 5, NULL, NULL),
('4ef47dfa-198c-527e-902c-c0e074b4cf62', '683a1a72-6900-4e3c-a063-dca54eb50d4a', '11e7164b-e47d-4b4d-8bad-1002c892ba20', 'a-level', '1.5', '9702 coursebook 1.5 · Combining displacements', 44, 44, 'An orienteer runs 800 m on a bearing of 000°, then 600 m on a bearing of 270°, then 400 m on a bearing of 180°. (a) Find the net north and west displacements. (b) Calculate the distance from the start. (c) Find the bearing from the start.', NULL, 3, 'numeric'::answer_type, '303.7', '°', false, NULL, false, NULL, '(a) North: 800 − 400 = 400 m; west: 600 m. (b) s = √(400² + 600²) = 721 m. (c) Angle west of north = tan⁻¹(600 ÷ 400) = 56.3°; bearing = 360 − 56.3 = 304°. Mark scheme (6 marks). C1: north. C1: west. C1: magnitude. M1: angle from north. C1: bearing. A1: bearing = 304°.', 6, '<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 360 280" role="img" aria-labelledby="fg6a8b4d0b-t fg6a8b4d0b-d" style="font-family:ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,''Segoe UI'',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;max-width:100%;height:auto"><title id="fg6a8b4d0b-t">Orienteering course</title><desc id="fg6a8b4d0b-d">Legs of 800 m north, 600 m west and 400 m south; the resultant is dashed.</desc><line x1="250.5" y1="234" x2="250.5" y2="52.3" style="stroke:var(--fig-accent,#1d4ed8);stroke-width:2.0;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><polygon points="250.5,46 254.3,54.2 246.7,54.2" style="fill:var(--fig-accent,#1d4ed8);stroke:none"/><text x="264.5" y="144" font-size="12" text-anchor="start" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:var(--fig-accent,#1d4ed8)">800 m</text><line x1="250.5" y1="46" x2="115.8" y2="46" style="stroke:var(--fig-accent-2,#b45309);stroke-width:2.0;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><polygon points="109.5,46 117.7,42.2 117.7,49.8" style="fill:var(--fig-accent-2,#b45309);stroke:none"/><text x="180" y="32" font-size="12" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:var(--fig-accent-2,#b45309)">600 m</text><line x1="109.5" y1="46" x2="109.5" y2="133.7" style="stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:2.0;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><polygon points="109.5,140 105.7,131.8 113.3,131.8" style="fill:currentColor;stroke:none"/><text x="95.5" y="97" font-size="12" text-anchor="end" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:currentColor">400 m</text><line x1="250.5" y1="234" x2="114.7" y2="143.5" style="stroke:var(--fig-muted,#6b7280);stroke-width:1.4;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round;stroke-dasharray:6 4"/><polygon points="109.5,140 118.4,141.4 114.2,147.7" style="fill:var(--fig-muted,#6b7280);stroke:none"/><text x="187.8" y="175.4" font-size="12" text-anchor="start" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:var(--fig-muted,#6b7280)">s</text><circle cx="250.5" cy="234" r="3.4" style="fill:currentColor;stroke:none"/><line x1="338" y1="50" x2="338" y2="22.9" style="stroke:var(--fig-muted,#6b7280);stroke-width:1.4;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><polygon points="338,18 341,24.3 335,24.3" style="fill:var(--fig-muted,#6b7280);stroke:none"/><text x="338" y="9" font-size="12" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:currentColor;font-weight:600">N</text></svg>', 'Legs of 800 m north, 600 m west and 400 m south; the resultant is dashed.'),
('da50ed74-80fc-5c4b-86a7-40efbf1b4c7f', '683a1a72-6900-4e3c-a063-dca54eb50d4a', '11e7164b-e47d-4b4d-8bad-1002c892ba20', 'a-level', '1.5', '9702 coursebook 1.5 · Combining displacements', 45, 45, 'A displacement of 15 km has an eastward component of 9.0 km. (a) Calculate its northward component (it points north of east). (b) Calculate its angle north of east.', NULL, 3, 'numeric'::answer_type, '53.13', '°', false, NULL, false, NULL, '(a) N = √(15² − 9.0²) = 12 km. (b) θ = cos⁻¹(9.0 ÷ 15) = 53.1°. Mark scheme (5 marks). M1: Pythagoras rearranged. C1: 12 km. M1: cos θ. C1: value. A1: θ = 53.1°.', 5, NULL, NULL),
('bc08a0a0-2d38-500e-bde8-4ce1b9683108', '683a1a72-6900-4e3c-a063-dca54eb50d4a', '11e7164b-e47d-4b4d-8bad-1002c892ba20', 'a-level', '1.5', '9702 coursebook 1.5 · Combining displacements', 46, 46, 'A climber moves 30 m up a slope inclined at 35° to the horizontal and then 20 m horizontally. (a) Find the horizontal and vertical components of the first leg. (b) Calculate the magnitude of the total displacement.', NULL, 3, 'numeric'::answer_type, '47.78', 'm', false, NULL, false, NULL, '(a) Horizontal = 30 cos 35° = 24.57 m; vertical = 30 sin 35° = 17.21 m. (b) s = √((24.57 + 20)² + (17.21)²) = 47.8 m. Mark scheme (5 marks). C1: horizontal. C1: vertical. M1: add horizontal. C1: Pythagoras. A1: s = 47.8 m.', 5, '<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 360 280" role="img" aria-labelledby="fgd4fe7845-t fgd4fe7845-d" style="font-family:ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,''Segoe UI'',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;max-width:100%;height:auto"><title id="fgd4fe7845-t">Climb then traverse</title><desc id="fgd4fe7845-d">A climb of 30 m up a 35° slope followed by 20 m horizontally; the resultant displacement is dashed.</desc><line x1="53.2" y1="188.9" x2="187.8" y2="94.7" style="stroke:var(--fig-accent,#1d4ed8);stroke-width:2.0;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><polygon points="193,91.1 188.5,98.9 184.1,92.6" style="fill:var(--fig-accent,#1d4ed8);stroke:none"/><text x="115.1" y="128.5" font-size="12" text-anchor="end" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:var(--fig-accent,#1d4ed8)">30 m</text><line x1="193" y1="91.1" x2="300.5" y2="91.1" style="stroke:var(--fig-accent-2,#b45309);stroke-width:2.0;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><polygon points="306.8,91.1 298.6,94.9 298.6,87.3" style="fill:var(--fig-accent-2,#b45309);stroke:none"/><text x="249.9" y="77.1" font-size="12" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:var(--fig-accent-2,#b45309)">20 m</text><line x1="53.2" y1="188.9" x2="300.9" y2="93.3" style="stroke:var(--fig-muted,#6b7280);stroke-width:1.4;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round;stroke-dasharray:6 4"/><polygon points="306.8,91.1 300.5,97.6 297.8,90.5" style="fill:var(--fig-muted,#6b7280);stroke:none"/><text x="175" y="126.9" font-size="12" text-anchor="end" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:var(--fig-muted,#6b7280)">s</text><circle cx="53.2" cy="188.9" r="3.4" style="fill:currentColor;stroke:none"/></svg>', 'A climb of 30 m up a 35° slope followed by 20 m horizontally; the resultant displacement is dashed.'),
('78a210a2-623c-5f60-9083-2a541ebec15b', '683a1a72-6900-4e3c-a063-dca54eb50d4a', '11e7164b-e47d-4b4d-8bad-1002c892ba20', 'a-level', '1.5', '9702 coursebook 1.5 · Combining displacements', 47, 47, 'A boat sails 10 km on a bearing of 045° and then 10 km on a bearing of 315°. (a) Calculate the resultant east and north components. (b) Calculate the magnitude. (c) State its direction.', NULL, 3, 'numeric'::answer_type, '14.14 km', 'km', false, NULL, false, NULL, '(a) East: 10 sin 45° + 10 sin 315° = 0; north: 10 cos 45° + 10 cos 315° = 14.14 km. (b) s = 20 × cos 45° = 14.1 km. (c) Due north. Mark scheme (6 marks). C1: east components cancel. C1: north sum. M1: resultant. C1: value. B1: due north. A1: s = 14.1 km.', 6, '<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 360 280" role="img" aria-labelledby="fg1c751d50-t fg1c751d50-d" style="font-family:ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,''Segoe UI'',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;max-width:100%;height:auto"><title id="fg1c751d50-t">North-east then north-west</title><desc id="fg1c751d50-d">A boat sails 10 km on a bearing of 045° then 10 km on a bearing of 315°; the resultant is dashed.</desc><line x1="133" y1="234" x2="222.5" y2="144.5" style="stroke:var(--fig-accent,#1d4ed8);stroke-width:2.0;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><polygon points="227,140 223.9,148.5 218.5,143.1" style="fill:var(--fig-accent,#1d4ed8);stroke:none"/><text x="189.9" y="196.9" font-size="12" text-anchor="start" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:var(--fig-accent,#1d4ed8)">10 km</text><line x1="227" y1="140" x2="137.5" y2="50.5" style="stroke:var(--fig-accent-2,#b45309);stroke-width:2.0;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><polygon points="133,46 141.5,49.1 136.1,54.5" style="fill:var(--fig-accent-2,#b45309);stroke:none"/><text x="189.9" y="83.1" font-size="12" text-anchor="start" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:var(--fig-accent-2,#b45309)">10 km</text><line x1="133" y1="234" x2="133" y2="52.3" style="stroke:var(--fig-muted,#6b7280);stroke-width:1.4;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round;stroke-dasharray:6 4"/><polygon points="133,46 136.8,54.2 129.2,54.2" style="fill:var(--fig-muted,#6b7280);stroke:none"/><text x="147" y="140" font-size="12" text-anchor="start" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:var(--fig-muted,#6b7280)">s</text><circle cx="133" cy="234" r="3.4" style="fill:currentColor;stroke:none"/><line x1="338" y1="50" x2="338" y2="22.9" style="stroke:var(--fig-muted,#6b7280);stroke-width:1.4;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><polygon points="338,18 341,24.3 335,24.3" style="fill:var(--fig-muted,#6b7280);stroke:none"/><text x="338" y="9" font-size="12" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:currentColor;font-weight:600">N</text></svg>', 'A boat sails 10 km on a bearing of 045° then 10 km on a bearing of 315°; the resultant is dashed.'),
('b8a42a74-0519-570c-a4da-6138ddcc1fe3', '683a1a72-6900-4e3c-a063-dca54eb50d4a', '11e7164b-e47d-4b4d-8bad-1002c892ba20', 'a-level', '1.5', '9702 coursebook 1.5 · Combining displacements', 48, 48, 'Two displacements, 6.0 m and 9.0 m, have a resultant of 12 m. (a) Use the cosine rule to find the angle in the triangle opposite the 12 m side. (b) State the angle between the two displacements when drawn from a common point.', NULL, 3, 'numeric'::answer_type, '75.52', '°', false, NULL, false, NULL, '(a) cos C = (6.0² + 9.0² − 12²) ÷ (2 × 6.0 × 9.0) = −0.250, C = 104.5°. (b) Angle = 180 − 104.5 = 75.5°. Mark scheme (5 marks). M1: cosine rule rearranged. C1: angle in triangle. M1: supplement. C1: value. A1: θ = 75.5°.', 5, NULL, NULL),
('dd79717f-6f63-5025-b2a7-4dd8c2416e10', '683a1a72-6900-4e3c-a063-dca54eb50d4a', '11e7164b-e47d-4b4d-8bad-1002c892ba20', 'a-level', '1.5', '9702 coursebook 1.5 · Combining displacements', 49, 49, 'A walker goes 2.0 km east, 3.0 km north, 4.0 km east and 5.0 km north. (a) Find the net components. (b) Calculate the magnitude of the displacement. (c) Calculate its angle north of east.', NULL, 3, 'numeric'::answer_type, '53.13', '°', false, NULL, false, NULL, '(a) East 6.0 km, north 8.0 km. (b) s = √(6.0² + 8.0²) = 10 km. (c) θ = tan⁻¹(8.0 ÷ 6.0) = 53.1°. Mark scheme (6 marks). C1: east. C1: north. C1: magnitude. M1: tan θ. C1: value. A1: θ = 53.1°.', 6, '<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 360 280" role="img" aria-labelledby="fg793c4a13-t fg793c4a13-d" style="font-family:ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,''Segoe UI'',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;max-width:100%;height:auto"><title id="fg793c4a13-t">Staircase walk</title><desc id="fg793c4a13-d">A walk of 2.0 km east, 3.0 km north, 4.0 km east and 5.0 km north, drawn head to tail.</desc><line x1="109.5" y1="234" x2="150.2" y2="234" style="stroke:var(--fig-accent,#1d4ed8);stroke-width:2.0;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><polygon points="156.5,234 148.3,237.8 148.3,230.2" style="fill:var(--fig-accent,#1d4ed8);stroke:none"/><text x="133" y="248" font-size="12" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:var(--fig-accent,#1d4ed8)">2.0 km</text><line x1="156.5" y1="234" x2="156.5" y2="169.8" style="stroke:var(--fig-accent-2,#b45309);stroke-width:2.0;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><polygon points="156.5,163.5 160.3,171.7 152.7,171.7" style="fill:var(--fig-accent-2,#b45309);stroke:none"/><text x="142.5" y="202.8" font-size="12" text-anchor="end" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:var(--fig-accent-2,#b45309)">3.0 km</text><line x1="156.5" y1="163.5" x2="244.2" y2="163.5" style="stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:2.0;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><polygon points="250.5,163.5 242.3,167.3 242.3,159.7" style="fill:currentColor;stroke:none"/><text x="203.5" y="149.5" font-size="12" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:currentColor">4.0 km</text><line x1="250.5" y1="163.5" x2="250.5" y2="52.3" style="stroke:var(--fig-accent,#1d4ed8);stroke-width:2.0;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><polygon points="250.5,46 254.3,54.2 246.7,54.2" style="fill:var(--fig-accent,#1d4ed8);stroke:none"/><text x="264.5" y="108.8" font-size="12" text-anchor="start" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:var(--fig-accent,#1d4ed8)">5.0 km</text><circle cx="109.5" cy="234" r="3.4" style="fill:currentColor;stroke:none"/><line x1="338" y1="50" x2="338" y2="22.9" style="stroke:var(--fig-muted,#6b7280);stroke-width:1.4;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><polygon points="338,18 341,24.3 335,24.3" style="fill:var(--fig-muted,#6b7280);stroke:none"/><text x="338" y="9" font-size="12" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:currentColor;font-weight:600">N</text></svg>', 'A walk of 2.0 km east, 3.0 km north, 4.0 km east and 5.0 km north, drawn head to tail.'),
('0c9306ae-b0af-5e99-9ad5-2b989723ce74', '683a1a72-6900-4e3c-a063-dca54eb50d4a', '11e7164b-e47d-4b4d-8bad-1002c892ba20', 'a-level', '1.5', '9702 coursebook 1.5 · Combining displacements', 50, 50, 'A plane must end up 500 km due north of its start. It first flies 300 km due east. (a) Find the components of the second leg it must fly. (b) Calculate the length of that leg.', NULL, 3, 'numeric'::answer_type, '583.1 km', 'km', false, NULL, false, NULL, '(a) 300 km west and 500 km north. (b) L = √(300² + 500²) = 583 km. Mark scheme (5 marks). M1: resultant − first leg. C1: components. M1: Pythagoras. C1: value. A1: L = 583 km.', 5, NULL, NULL),
('f7428a1c-38ae-544f-9938-5c4f8142a2be', '683a1a72-6900-4e3c-a063-dca54eb50d4a', '11e7164b-e47d-4b4d-8bad-1002c892ba20', 'a-level', '1.5', '9702 coursebook 1.5 · Combining displacements', 51, 51, 'A hiker walks 5.0 km on a bearing of 000°, 5.0 km on a bearing of 120° and 3.0 km on a bearing of 240°. (a) Explain why three equal legs at 120° to each other would cancel. (b) Hence calculate the magnitude of the resultant.', NULL, 3, 'numeric'::answer_type, '2 km', 'km', false, NULL, false, NULL, '(a) They form a closed equilateral triangle. (b) The third leg is 2.0 km short of closing it, so s = 5.0 − 3.0 = 2.0 km on a bearing of 060°. Mark scheme (5 marks). B1: closed triangle. M1: shortfall in third leg. C1: magnitude. C1: direction. A1: s = 2.0 km.', 5, '<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 360 280" role="img" aria-labelledby="fg5249bb24-t fg5249bb24-d" style="font-family:ui-sans-serif,system-ui,-apple-system,''Segoe UI'',Roboto,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif;max-width:100%;height:auto"><title id="fg5249bb24-t">Nearly closed triangle</title><desc id="fg5249bb24-d">Legs of 5.0 km on 000°, 5.0 km on 120° and 3.0 km on 240°; the short resultant is dashed.</desc><line x1="98.6" y1="234" x2="98.6" y2="52.3" style="stroke:var(--fig-accent,#1d4ed8);stroke-width:2.0;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><polygon points="98.6,46 102.4,54.2 94.8,54.2" style="fill:var(--fig-accent,#1d4ed8);stroke:none"/><text x="84.6" y="144" font-size="12" text-anchor="end" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:var(--fig-accent,#1d4ed8)">5.0 km</text><line x1="98.6" y1="46" x2="256" y2="136.8" style="stroke:var(--fig-accent-2,#b45309);stroke-width:2.0;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><polygon points="261.4,140 252.4,139.2 256.2,132.6" style="fill:var(--fig-accent-2,#b45309);stroke:none"/><text x="187" y="80.9" font-size="12" text-anchor="start" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:var(--fig-accent-2,#b45309)">5.0 km</text><line x1="261.4" y1="140" x2="169.2" y2="193.2" style="stroke:currentColor;stroke-width:2.0;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><polygon points="163.7,196.4 168.9,189 172.7,195.6" style="fill:currentColor;stroke:none"/><text x="219.6" y="180.3" font-size="12" text-anchor="start" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:currentColor">3.0 km</text><line x1="98.6" y1="234" x2="158.3" y2="199.6" style="stroke:var(--fig-muted,#6b7280);stroke-width:1.4;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round;stroke-dasharray:6 4"/><polygon points="163.7,196.4 158.6,203.8 154.8,197.2" style="fill:var(--fig-muted,#6b7280);stroke:none"/><text x="124.2" y="203.1" font-size="12" text-anchor="end" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:var(--fig-muted,#6b7280)">s</text><circle cx="98.6" cy="234" r="3.4" style="fill:currentColor;stroke:none"/><line x1="338" y1="50" x2="338" y2="22.9" style="stroke:var(--fig-muted,#6b7280);stroke-width:1.4;fill:none;stroke-linecap:round;stroke-linejoin:round"/><polygon points="338,18 341,24.3 335,24.3" style="fill:var(--fig-muted,#6b7280);stroke:none"/><text x="338" y="9" font-size="12" text-anchor="middle" dominant-baseline="central" style="fill:currentColor;font-weight:600">N</text></svg>', 'Legs of 5.0 km on 000°, 5.0 km on 120° and 3.0 km on 240°; the short resultant is dashed.')
